<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head><meta charset="UTF-8"><title>Immigration Services Retainer Agreement</title></head>
<body>
<h1>Immigration Consulting Retainer Agreement</h1>
<p><strong>Date:</strong> {{date}}</p>

<h2>Parties</h2>
<p>This retainer agreement is entered into between the immigration consulting firm
(<strong>Firm ID:</strong> {{firmId}}) and the client:</p>
<p><strong>Client Name:</strong> {{applicantName}}<br>
<strong>Client Email:</strong> {{applicantEmail}}</p>

<h2>Scope of Services</h2>
<p>The firm agrees to provide the following immigration consulting services:</p>
<p>{{servicesDescription}}</p>
<p>Additional details on scope: {{scopeNotes}}</p>

<h2>Fees</h2>
<p><strong>Professional Fee:</strong> {{professionalFee}} CAD</p>
<p><strong>Disbursements:</strong> {{disbursements}} CAD (government fees, courier, translation, etc.)</p>
<p>All client funds are held in a segregated trust account and applied to fees
only when earned in accordance with the services rendered.</p>

<h2>Consultant's Obligations</h2>
<ol>
  <li>Maintain RCIC registration and comply with CICC Code of Professional Ethics.</li>
  <li>Act in the best interest of the client at all times.</li>
  <li>Provide timely updates on the progress of the application.</li>
  <li>Maintain the confidentiality of all client information.</li>
</ol>

<h2>Client's Obligations</h2>
<ol>
  <li>Provide accurate and complete information and documents as requested.</li>
  <li>Notify the consultant of any change in circumstances that may affect the application.</li>
  <li>Pay fees in accordance with this agreement.</li>
</ol>

<h2>Termination</h2>
<p>Either party may terminate this agreement with written notice. Earned fees are
non-refundable; trust funds in excess of earned fees will be returned to the client
within 30 days of termination.</p>

<h2>Governing Law</h2>
<p>This agreement is governed by the laws of Canada and the province of {{province}}.</p>

<h2>Signature</h2>
<p>By signing below, the client agrees to the terms of this retainer agreement.</p>
<div class="signature-area">
  <p>Client Signature: ______________________________</p>
  <p>Date: ______________________________</p>
</div>
</body>
</html>
